WEBVTT

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.285
Welcome, new user.

00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:05.910
Bringing thirty-four agents online.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:08.668
Seven divisions. One command.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.792
Linking every agent.

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:25.264
Live fleet status.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:31.466
Meet the fleet.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:34.657
Command. Vic runs the fleet and its capital.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:41.421
Revenue. Roy leads twelve agents: Amazon, Walmart, the websites, search, social and reviews.

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:45.312
Advertising. A new chief for Amazon, Google and Bing.

00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:50.052
Operations. Otto runs the books, payroll, banking and the inbox.

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:53.479
Events. Eve runs the shows, dates and lodging.

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:55.727
Ventures. Vance and Jules.

00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:57.721
Dash, the trading coach.
